<title>JAPAN: Tokyo oil products market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Tokyo oil products market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tokyo oil products market is closed for a national holiday on Monday. Trade will resume on Tuesday.</p>
<p>On Friday, naphtha prices were mostly stable in quiet trade.</p>
<p>Open-spec naphtha for the latter half February was assessed at $239.00/$240.00, barely changed from late Thursday's levels. First-half March was quoted at $236.00/237.00.</p>
</text>
